\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Budgeted reconstruction from historical benchmark scores. Each source is fitted separately. Masked historical measurements yield benchmark factors; a variance proxy chooses an available benchmark; purchased scores determine a latent representation used to predict the unpurchased remainder. The query rule does not condition on purchased values. The evaluated remainder changes with the query policy.}}{2}{figure.caption.1}\protected@file@percent }
\providecommand*\caption@xref[2]{\@setref\relax\@undefined{#1}}
\newlabel{fig:overview}{{1}{2}{Budgeted reconstruction from historical benchmark scores. Each source is fitted separately. Masked historical measurements yield benchmark factors; a variance proxy chooses an available benchmark; purchased scores determine a latent representation used to predict the unpurchased remainder. The query rule does not condition on purchased values. The evaluated remainder changes with the query policy}{figure.caption.1}{}}
